{"id": "7be289d5-6895-49dd-b7b7-fb3d2b911e85", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "This is a broad resource survey across the account — pulling full RDS/Aurora instance and cluster inventories plus engine version support metadata would be a lot of intermediate data that's not useful to show you raw. I'll have someone gather it and bring back just the structured findings.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "tooluse_70yjvScFwaZHIZafb4536H", "tool_name": "gather_context", "input": {"prompt": "{
  "task": "Run a read-only RDS/Aurora upgrade-readiness audit for this AWS account in us-east-1, across ALL database engines (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MariaDB, Oracle, SQL Server, Aurora MySQL, Aurora PostgreSQL).",
  "context": "User wants a full upgrade-readiness audit report. For every database instance and cluster, report the engine, current engine version, and support status (supported / deprecated / approaching end of support). Group results by engine. For any flagged as deprecated or approaching end of support, recommend a specific upgrade target version. This is read-only reporting only -- no mutating actions.",
  "resources": ["RDS DB instances in us-east-1", "RDS DB clusters (Aurora) in us-east-1", "describe_db_engine_versions for support/deprecation metadata"],
  "timeframe": "current state as of now",
  "criteria": "For each DB instance/cluster: engine type, engine version, current support status. Use describe_db_engine_versions (and if available, check for any deprecated or end-of-support flags on the version) to determine support status for each version in use. Group all findings by engine type. For every DB flagged deprecated or nearing end of support, state a specific recommended target engine version to upgrade to (pick the latest stable/supported version for that major engine track, or next LTS version if applicable). Produce a complete structured summary suitable for turning into a full audit report: total DB count, counts by engine, list of all DBs with engine+version+status, and a highlighted list of action items (deprecated/EOL-approaching DBs with recommended targets)."
}"}, "type": "tool_use", "display_intent": "Survey RDS/Aurora instances and engine versions in us-east-1, check support status"}], "created_at": null}
